{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Movement｜原生移动与来源生命周期流程\n主链横向：原输入／配置门禁 → Candidate → 普通段求值或Stage → native实际区间Prepare／唯一Consume → 胶囊执行 → 只读表现。上方来源／Input／Owner与下方回放／ASC是原生命周期接口。\n[[Movement/结构|结构与接口]] · [[Movement/计划_移动与动作位移|现行方案／延期项]] · [[Movement/GGYGO_结构_移动与位移.canvas|结构图]]\n2026-10-05 Gate91编译exit0，必要烟3Success／1Fail；七旧DA已实际退役。正式Run／攻击位移／完整网络、AnimBP相位未验。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2900,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1. Hero 提交原移动意图\n原Source请求仍Held且Session／Binding匹配 → Input_Move → AddMovementInput。\nForceWalk → CMC原请求接口。\n轴值进入原move模拟；资格来自上方原Fact消费，不从速度／零轴猜Press／Release。\nGadge／GA_Dodge只占位，RequestRunOnNextMove无调用方。\n[[Input/结构|输入来源]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "resolve",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3. 分支：纯求值／Stage 原源\n普通WalkStart／WalkRun：\n原Sequence或实际BS纯求值 → 成功Commit语义／time／cycle／样本 → native物理。\nWalkRun：原BS权重与周期，各源先求速度向量／Yaw再混合；抵消0为合法。\nStop／TurnBack：\nStageLocomotionCurveRootMotion(tick,Candidate,error)捕获原Origin／SourceBinding／Input，挂既有CurveRMS。\n不按整帧dt预求RMS或提交其时间。\n普通失败携原原因→Reject原请求。\n[[Movement/结构#纯求值与普通移动提交|纯算法]]",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "curve",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2. Before 准备原 Candidate\nUpdateCharacterStateBeforeMovement核对accepted Set、原执行请求、接地／CantMove／Action优先级。\nTryUpdateLocomotion捕获Candidate → ResolveGait → UpdateWalkRunBlend。\n持续保持达原Hold阈值Walk升Run，Alpha向0／1插值；释放／ForceWalk等按既有规则清计时。\n选WalkStart／WalkRun；松开按阶段选StartStop／WalkStop／RunStop；Run反向进TurnBack。\n缺／坏来源明确拒绝，不开固定模式或制造执行号。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "physics",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4. native Prepare／Consume／物理\nStop／TurnBack原RMS PrepareRootMotion(sim,tick) → 原CMC Prepare：核对原group／Origin／Input／SourceBinding。\n实时t0=OriginMotion+(SourceTime−OriginSource)，t1=t0+sim；原Sequence端点Speed／Dir、区间Yaw，推进TurnBack。\nCMC Consume同Prepared一次Commit → RMS安装世界端点速度×sim/tick、native时间／结束状态 → CMC原物理执行胶囊／碰撞。\nStop正sim且原Sample.Speed恰为0（RootMotionScale前）才自然结束；正小值／Scale=0不提前结束。TurnBack按阶段，正常离地／已结束保原动量。\n普通段直接沿GetMaxSpeed／CalcVelocity／PhysicsRotation／MoveAlongFloor。\n零sim不制造预算；非平移积分，旧贡献仅退自己。",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "saved",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5. 原 move 保存与回放\nSetMoveFor原语义＋不可变SourceBinding＋Input checkpoint＋Owner身份。\nPostUpdate保原Input／Prepared；Replay不覆盖，来源改变／有关RMS限制合并。\nPrepMoveFor在native Super前BeginReplay原记录＋SavedRootMotion group；Prepared有却缺原native source时拒绝，不借当前组。\n非权威回放沿原基线／来源；authority走右侧重算，不能提交旧速度。\nClear／EndReplay清原借用引用，不清FAILED／后继准入。\nNetSerialize加载清本地Origin／Prepared；导入Origin未认证。\n[[Movement/结构#SavedMove 原绑定与权威校正|原记录契约]]",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "anim",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6. 只读移动事实 → AnimBP\nAnimationStateFrame Capture提交后的Gait、Alpha、StopType、TurnBack等事实。\nABP_Pyrios原单WalkRun BS：X=0 Walk／1 Run；Alpha→旧StateMemory.GaitBlendY，StopType→StopValue 0／1／2。\n原EnterMove／WalkRun／Stop／TurnBack拓扑保留。\nPlayer／Evaluator相位未迁移；无同钟／无脚滑承诺。公共命名WalkRunBlendAlpha，walkRun／GaitBlendY兼容保留；轴显示名保存未验。\n[[Animation/结构|表现接口]]",
      "x": 2390,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 370,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "target",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 配置分发与实际资产状态\nSystem同GI原InitState顺序 → Extension.DataInitialized → 唯一SetMovementSet。\nValidateMovementSet仅16项数值；GetMovementSet只读actual accepted配置。曲线模式另须合格来源；显式false才固定速度。\n七旧Locomotion DA已实际删：默认Set七废弃引用null／十九参数位模式保持；八原包备份、完整incoming为空、冷Registry目标／节点缺席、dirty=[]。\n两Stop三DirX键值精确保存／冷读，raw骨键／Channel未验。独立ActionProfile未改。\n[[Movement/结构#验收、退役与剩余边界|验收与失败]]",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "movement-test-validation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## 必要门禁／历史运行\nGate91编译exit0；RawAndScaled／StrictValidation／AuthorityAndMapping Success。\nFailedRequestRecovery原两非法速度Error、请求3完成，仍Fail。\n校正0.416／292／Prepared不可变通过。\nL_Movement_Test历史38秒／4513帧Run为新来源前，不能证明当前Run。\n正式W→Run／攻击／网络未验。\n[[Movement/移动测试关卡|历史入口]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "explicit-action",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2200,
      "width": 1420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 独立入口：GA 显式动作位移\nGA业务ActionMotionProfile／Montage／PlayRate → BeginActionMotion → 精确Handle → 原ActionCurveRMS累计轨迹差分 → CMC胶囊执行。\n在场抑制Locomotion／自动旋转；EndActionMotion(原Handle)、自然结束／离地清原资源，Set重绑不结束Action。\n独立业务曲线未参与七DA退役；GA管生命周期／资源，Animation管Montage窗口。\nPlayerCombo仍Montage-only，未接BeginActionMotion或发CantMove，不能称生产攻击位移问题已闭合。\n[[Movement/GGYGO_流程_动作曲线执行.canvas|动作子图]] · [[Movement/动作曲线执行|独立契约与状态]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluation-failure",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原请求拒绝／失败／精确退场\n普通求值false → RejectLocomotionEvaluation(originalSerial,error)。\n原native Prepare失败 → ReportLocomotionCurveRootMotionFailure(Origin,error) → 既有FailLocomotionRequest原号。\n不Commit候选／时间、不补0号请求；旧Origin仅退自身贡献，不失败／清后继或Action。\nReset、改Set、Ready、零Acceleration、同Started不重开FAILED；真实释放／中性／合格新Press才走新请求。\nReset／EndPlay／回放退出精确清自己的引用，沿原请求一次诊断。\n[[Movement/结构#原请求失败与 Input 消费|拒绝契约]]",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "input-consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原 Fact 入口：Input → Hero → CMC\nBindMovementInputSession → ConsumeMovementInputFact(Binding,Fact,Error)／Invalidate。\n校验原身份、Kind／Mode／Proof／Event；输出Recorded／Duplicate／Stale／Rejected。\nOpened Cold／Rearm，Cold首Started一次窗在配置／执行失败前耗尽；ReleasedThenPhysicalPress须真实Neutral且无open请求。\n同Event完整payload才Duplicate且不重执行；旧Request高Event仍Stale、不提升水位。Unresolved只撤自己的关联。\n合格请求沿CMC唯一执行号准入；零轴不是Released，Held归Source。\nHero1首次Owner等待后查询Source仍Held，一次TryAdmit；Ready不合成Press。\n已编译；正式物理首按／Run未验。\n[[Input/结构|发行边界]]",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "local-asc-prepare-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 独立原资源链：ASC 身份与 CantMove\nBeginPlay Cache → 原Extension → PrepareLocalAbilitySystemSubscription一次Register…AndCall，先持原记录、同步Replay／晚返回仅归原Handle。\nReady核对原opaque／Owner／PublishedContext；新opaque更新派生缓存并Reset，同Ready／Refreshed不Reset，晚Released不清后继。\n模拟中const Ready Getter查询CantMove；无Ready是合法暂态，不授输入资格或替代速度。\nEndPlay先封闭native／Owner在途入口，退CurveRMS／回放，再Release精确ASC订阅、失效Input／原Scope，Super。\n资源不是曲线时钟／请求权威；已编译，独立动态未验。\n[[Movement/结构#本地 ASC 身份订阅|订阅与清理]] · [[Character/结构|发布源]]",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 2200,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "native-owner-sync-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## 原 Owner 同步 → 首次请求准入\nGetScope → Subscribe先装原Observer再Replay；Unsubscribe精确取消原项，原Scope／nonce／server generation归CMC原生生命周期。\nSetMoveFor捕获原代际 → Owner v2实际packed move → native timestamp／正delta／PC门禁 → MoveAutonomous原receipt。\nServerFillResponse匹配原PendingAdjustment → ACK／correction → client核对原身份／代际 → native完整返回后Ready。\nM3原请求Waiting → Hero查询Source原Session仍Held → TryAdmit原Observer／Binding／Request／ReadyNotice一次准入。\nReady仅同步就绪，不清FAILED、不补Press、不改旧SavedMove；真实owner更替退休原范围。\n已编译；正式owner／server／proxy／网络未验，本地Origin导入未认证。\n[[Movement/结构#原生移动 Owner 同步|生命周期／接口]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "source-publication-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 530,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 原来源生命周期：Animation → CMC\n原Initialize／Update观察Owner／Mesh／主Producer／AnimSet配置 → Resolve原五Sequence／walkRun实际BS样本。\n构造不可变Binding：原身份／代际、元信息、强资产引用、Available或明确Missing／Invalid／Stale。\nPublishLocomotionSourceBinding验证并接收；bool只是receipt，曲线执行另ValidateBinding／当前身份。\n缺路由／缺曲线／坏元信息拒绝原请求，不选替代动画或固定速度。\n原Uninitialize／配置更替 → Retire(原Producer,原配置代际)，只撤自身发布／Locomotion；SavedMove／Origin保原绑定，不查当前AnimInstance。\n固定模式无resolver是正常可选缺席，无第二时钟／Tick。\n[[Animation/曲线处理|动画唯一来源]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "authority-recompute-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2390,
      "y": 1520,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 530,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## authority 回放重算实际区间\n先装原SavedMove记录／native group；原Prepared存在却缺匹配源时明确拒绝。\n原Prepared只供actual sim／tick／native区间元信息。\nauthority Candidate.MotionTime作为t0基线，t1=t0+actual sim；原SourceBinding／Sequence重求Sample／OverrideVelocity，产生新的Prepared。\nbReplayPreparedFromAuthority → 同一CMC唯一Consume，禁止提交旧Candidate／速度。\nGate91：0.4→0.416、speed292、原Prepared时间0.016／引用不变均通过。\n本地未possessed authority夹具，不代表正式自主客户端／网络。\n[[Movement/结构#SavedMove 原绑定与权威校正|契约与证据]]"
    }
  ],
